What this is
------------
The PRD-AUTHORING half of the nocode-PRD pipeline: it helps PMs write / upgrade /
self-check PRDs that pass the R&D team's nocode 准入 gate, then publishes them to
Lark via lark-cli — across Claude Code / Codex / Gemini / Kiro from one shared core.

Relationship to the nocode review gate
--------------------------------------
This Kit is built ON TOP OF and COMPLEMENTS the R&D team's nocode review/准入
product (the prd-review skill and its 18-check system), authored by @coast.lin.
The 18 admission checks mirrored under references/checks/ are that gate's work,
credited to @coast.lin; this Kit consumes them so authors can comply easily.
Authoring (this Kit, Noah Zhan) + Review (@coast.lin's gate) = the full pipeline.

